{"id":"lesson-src-d480bbe133d3a8","moduleNumber":248,"headword":"area","title":"Area","subtitle":"「區域／範圍／領域／方面」，有哪些真正接近、廣泛可用，或在特定語境中很自然的替代表達？","description":"「區域／範圍／領域／方面」，有哪些真正接近、廣泛可用，或在特定語境中很自然的替代表達？","words":[{"order":1,"word":"Region","meaning":"地區；區域","note":"指較大的地理範圍，常帶行政、自然或文化區域感。","example":"This region is known for its vineyards.","exampleZh":"這個地區以葡萄園聞名。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"This area is famous for its vineyards.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"region","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"region","explanation":"大範圍地理區域自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"location","explanation":"更偏具體位置。"},{"letter":"C","text":"site","explanation":"太局部。"},{"letter":"D","text":"room","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The northern area receives more rainfall.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"region","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"region","explanation":"自然地理分區。"},{"letter":"B","text":"spot","explanation":"太小。"},{"letter":"C","text":"site","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"floor","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The disease is common in tropical areas.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"regions","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"regions","explanation":"氣候地區語境自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"locations","explanation":"可用但較點狀。"},{"letter":"C","text":"sites","explanation":"不自然。"},{"letter":"D","text":"rooms","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":2,"word":"Zone","meaning":"區域；地帶","note":"指因功能、用途、規則或特徵而劃分出的區域。","example":"Parking is not allowed in this zone.","exampleZh":"這個區域禁止泊車。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Parking is prohibited in this area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"zone","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"zone","explanation":"規則劃定區域。"},{"letter":"B","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The factory is located in an industrial area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"zone","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"zone","explanation":"固定用途地帶。"},{"letter":"B","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"part","explanation":"可理解但不如 zone 精確。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Do not enter the dangerous area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"zone","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"zone","explanation":"danger zone 是固定自然搭配。"},{"letter":"B","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"section","explanation":"較弱。"}]}]},{"order":3,"word":"District","meaning":"地區；行政區；街區","note":"常指城市內部或行政上劃分的區域。","example":"The restaurant is located in the financial district.","exampleZh":"這家餐廳位於金融區。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The restaurant is in the financial area of the city.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"district","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"district","explanation":"城市功能分區自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"She lives in a historic area near the centre.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"district","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"district","explanation":"城市歷史區。"},{"letter":"B","text":"site","explanation":"太具體。"},{"letter":"C","text":"spot","explanation":"太小。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The school serves children from the surrounding area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"district","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"district","explanation":"若有行政／學區意味很自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"room","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":4,"word":"Locality","meaning":"地方；地區","note":"較正式地指某個特定地方或周邊地區。","example":"The plant is found only in a few coastal localities.","exampleZh":"這種植物只在少數沿海地區出現。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The plant grows only in a few coastal areas.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"localities","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"localities","explanation":"研究／地理語境正式。"},{"letter":"B","text":"rooms","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"fields","explanation":"會改變意思。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspects","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The survey covered several rural areas.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"localities","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"localities","explanation":"正式地區描述。"},{"letter":"B","text":"sites","explanation":"更具體。"},{"letter":"C","text":"spots","explanation":"較口語且太小。"},{"letter":"D","text":"realms","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Each area has its own transport needs.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"locality","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"locality","explanation":"地方／社區行政語感。"},{"letter":"B","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":5,"word":"Vicinity","meaning":"附近地區；鄰近範圍","note":"指某地點周圍的地區。","example":"There are several cafés in the vicinity of the station.","exampleZh":"車站附近有幾家咖啡店。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"There are several cafés in the area around the station.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"vicinity","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"vicinity","explanation":"表示附近地區。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"範圍太大。"},{"letter":"C","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sector","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Police searched the area near the building.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"vicinity","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"vicinity","explanation":"周邊地區。"},{"letter":"B","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"No parking is available in the immediate area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"vicinity","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"vicinity","explanation":"immediate vicinity 很自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"過大。"},{"letter":"C","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":6,"word":"Neighborhood / Neighbourhood","meaning":"社區；附近地區","note":"指人們居住的局部地區，通常比 area 更有社區感。","example":"The neighborhood has changed a lot in recent years.","exampleZh":"這個社區近年改變了很多。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"This area has many small family-run shops.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"neighborhood","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"neighborhood","explanation":"社區感自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"territory","explanation":"控制意味太強。"},{"letter":"C","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"They moved to a quieter area last year.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"neighborhood","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"neighborhood","explanation":"居住地區自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"zone","explanation":"較功能性。"},{"letter":"C","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sector","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The area is popular with young families.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"neighborhood","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"neighborhood","explanation":"住宅社區語境最自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"territory","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":7,"word":"Territory","meaning":"領土；範圍；地盤","note":"指由某國家、團體、動物或機構控制、使用或視為自己範圍的區域。","example":"The animals defend their territory from intruders.","exampleZh":"這些動物會保衛自己的領域不受入侵。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The animals defend their area from intruders.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"territory","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"territory","explanation":"控制／地盤意味。"},{"letter":"B","text":"space","explanation":"太中性。"},{"letter":"C","text":"region","explanation":"可太廣。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The group controls a large area along the border.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"territory","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"territory","explanation":"控制權是關鍵。"},{"letter":"B","text":"vicinity","explanation":"只是附近。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"section","explanation":"較弱。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"This area belongs to another administrative authority.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"territory","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"territory","explanation":"歸屬／管轄。"},{"letter":"B","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"sphere","explanation":"抽象。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":8,"word":"Space","meaning":"空間；地方","note":"指可供使用、活動、存放或存在的物理空間。","example":"There isn't enough space for another desk.","exampleZh":"沒有足夠空間再放一張桌子。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"There isn't enough area for another desk.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"space","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"space","explanation":"物理空間。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"We need a larger area for storage.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"space","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"space","explanation":"可用物理空間。"},{"letter":"B","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The room has an open area near the windows.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"space","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"space","explanation":"房間內空間。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sector","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":9,"word":"Section","meaning":"部分；區段；區域","note":"指整體中的一個明確部分。","example":"This section of the park is closed for repairs.","exampleZh":"公園的這一部分因維修而關閉。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"This area of the park is closed.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"section","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"section","explanation":"整體中的明確部分。"},{"letter":"B","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The damaged area of the road will be repaired first.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"section","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"section","explanation":"道路的一段。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Please complete the final area of the form.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"section","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"section","explanation":"文件部分。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"zone","explanation":"不自然。"},{"letter":"D","text":"territory","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":10,"word":"Part","meaning":"部分；一帶；一部分","note":"非常廣泛、自然，可指地方、物體、文章或系統中的一部分。","example":"This part of the city is especially busy at night.","exampleZh":"城市的這一帶晚上特別繁忙。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"This area of the city is very busy at night.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"part","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"part","explanation":"自然口語。"},{"letter":"B","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"抽象。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The western area of the building is being renovated.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"part","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"part","explanation":"一般部分。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"可理解但不自然。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Which area of the report needs revision?","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"part","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"part","explanation":"最一般自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"zone","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"territory","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":11,"word":"Field","meaning":"領域；範疇","note":"指學術、工作、研究或專業活動的領域。","example":"She works in the field of environmental science.","exampleZh":"她從事環境科學領域的工作。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"She works in the area of environmental science.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"field","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"field","explanation":"專業領域最自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"This is a rapidly developing area of research.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"field","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"field","explanation":"研究領域。"},{"letter":"B","text":"zone","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"part","explanation":"較弱。"},{"letter":"D","text":"locality","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"He has expertise in several areas.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"fields","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"fields","explanation":"多個專業領域。"},{"letter":"B","text":"regions","explanation":"地理。"},{"letter":"C","text":"spaces","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sections","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":12,"word":"Domain","meaning":"領域；範疇","note":"較正式，指知識、活動、專業或控制範圍。","example":"Cybersecurity is a rapidly changing domain.","exampleZh":"網絡安全是一個迅速變化的領域。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Cybersecurity is an important area of modern computing.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"domain","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"domain","explanation":"技術領域正式自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The issue falls outside my area of expertise.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"domain","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"domain","explanation":"正式的知識範圍。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"section","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"neighborhood","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"This area is governed by a different set of principles.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"domain","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"domain","explanation":"抽象知識／活動範圍。"},{"letter":"B","text":"locality","explanation":"地理。"},{"letter":"C","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":13,"word":"Sphere","meaning":"範圍；領域；圈子","note":"指活動、影響或興趣的範圍。","example":"The issue extends beyond the economic sphere.","exampleZh":"這個問題超越了經濟領域。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The issue extends beyond the economic area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"sphere","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"sphere","explanation":"活動／影響範圍。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"section","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"She became influential in the political area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"sphere","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"sphere","explanation":"political sphere 是固定搭配。"},{"letter":"B","text":"zone","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"part","explanation":"太一般。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The debate moved into the public area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"sphere","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"sphere","explanation":"public sphere 常見。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"space","explanation":"雖可抽象，但此處 sphere 更自然。"}]}]},{"order":14,"word":"Realm","meaning":"領域；範疇；世界","note":"較正式或文學化，可指某個知識、活動或思想範圍。","example":"The idea belongs more to the realm of theory than practice.","exampleZh":"這個想法較屬於理論而非實踐範疇。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The idea belongs more to the area of theory than practice.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"realm","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"realm","explanation":"realm of theory 很自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"section","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"This question falls within the area of ethics.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"realm","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"realm","explanation":"正式抽象範疇。"},{"letter":"B","text":"zone","explanation":"不自然。"},{"letter":"C","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"space","explanation":"較弱。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The technology was once considered part of the area of science fiction.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"realm","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"realm","explanation":"稍文學、自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"locality","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sector","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":15,"word":"Sector","meaning":"領域；行業；部門","note":"指經濟、產業或社會活動中的某一部分。","example":"The technology sector has grown rapidly.","exampleZh":"科技行業增長迅速。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"She works in the public area of the economy.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"sector","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"sector","explanation":"經濟／公共服務分部。"},{"letter":"B","text":"sphere","explanation":"可較抽象，但不如 sector 精確。"},{"letter":"C","text":"region","explanation":"地理。"},{"letter":"D","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The technology area has grown rapidly.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"sector","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"sector","explanation":"產業領域。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"section","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Investment increased across the energy area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"sector","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"sector","explanation":"產業語境最自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"realm","explanation":"太抽象。"},{"letter":"C","text":"region","explanation":"會變成地理。"},{"letter":"D","text":"space","explanation":"不自然。"}]}]},{"order":16,"word":"Aspect","meaning":"方面；層面","note":"當 area 指「某件事的一個方面」時，aspect 很接近。","example":"Cost is one important aspect of the decision.","exampleZh":"成本是這個決定的一個重要方面。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Cost is one important area of the decision.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"aspect","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"aspect","explanation":"某件事的一個方面。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"zone","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"We need to improve every area of customer service.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"aspect","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"aspect","explanation":"不同層面。"},{"letter":"B","text":"territory","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"vicinity","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sector","explanation":"會改變意思。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Safety is an area we need to examine carefully.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"aspect","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"aspect","explanation":"作為某問題的一個方面。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":17,"word":"Area of concern → Concern / Issue","meaning":"關注範圍；問題方面","note":"有時 area 出現在固定結構如 an area of concern，自然改寫可直接用 concern 或 issue。","example":"Safety remains a major area of concern.","exampleZh":"安全仍然是一個主要關注問題。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Safety remains a major area of concern.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"concern","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"concern","explanation":"自然壓縮固定結構。"},{"letter":"B","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Data security is another important problem area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"issue","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"issue","explanation":"問題範圍可直接改成 issue。"},{"letter":"B","text":"zone","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"locality","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"territory","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Cost control is an area that needs attention.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"issue","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"issue","explanation":"自然概念改寫。"},{"letter":"B","text":"district","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"space","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"region","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":18,"word":"Part of town","meaning":"城中一帶；某個地區","note":"常見口語表達，表示城市中的某一區。","example":"It's a quiet part of town.","exampleZh":"這是城中較安靜的一帶。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"It's a quiet area of the city.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"part of town","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"part of town","explanation":"自然口語。"},{"letter":"B","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sector","explanation":"會有產業意味。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"This area has many restaurants and cafés.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"part of town","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"part of town","explanation":"城市局部地區。"},{"letter":"B","text":"realm","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"field","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"aspect","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"They moved to a more expensive area.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"part of town","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"part of town","explanation":"住宅／城市語境自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"domain","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"section","explanation":"較機械。"},{"letter":"D","text":"sphere","explanation":"不合。"}]}]}],"falseSynonyms":[{"word":"Place","zh":"place 很廣，表示位置或地方，但未必帶有「一片區域」的意思。","point":""},{"word":"Location","zh":"location 指具體位置，通常比 area 更精確、更點狀。","point":""},{"word":"Site","zh":"site 指某建築、工程或活動所在的具體地點，不等於廣泛區域。","point":""},{"word":"Country","zh":"國家是特定政治實體，不是一般 area 的近義詞。","point":""},{"word":"City","zh":"城市是一種特定聚居地，不是所有 